  <!-- Section 5 -->
  <h2>5. Conclusion & Verification</h2>
  <p>The AI Question Paper Generator provides an end-to-end tool for educators, professors, and students to generate, customize, edit, and export examination papers. It works both online with Google Gemini API and offline with its built-in synthesis engine.</p>

